  <p>The production cost estimator on this site runs on the same discipline and is also ungated.</p>

  <h2>Does this page pass the tests it applies to everyone else?</h2>

  <p>Partly. A cost benchmark in this category should pass four tests: the sample is stated, the figures are absolute, the data is ungated, and the author does not sell the thing being priced. Nothing examined for this page passes all four.</p>

  <blockquote class="evidence">Nothing examined for this page that prices a brand content asset passes all four tests of a usable benchmark: a stated sample, absolute figures, open access and an author who does not sell the work. The only sources that pass all four price an hour of a person's time.</blockquote>
  <p class="source">Source: ranking pages, trade body instruments, a creative dataset and three national statistical series assessed against the four tests, September 2026.</p>

  <p>So here is this page scored against its own instrument, including the test it fails.</p>

